    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.09400177001953,
        21.884788513183594,
        86.86299896240234,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "edition",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        83.11911010742188,
        513.4279174804688,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "Remark:  Regimens recommended for adults reflect the need for four drugs in the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        96.98809814453125,
        513.4854736328125,
        110.339599609375
      ],
      "text": "intensive phase, especially in settings where there is a high prevalence of HIV or of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        110.71908569335938,
        510.20794677734375,
        124.13958740234375
      ],
      "text": "(8) isoniazid resistance  . A major reason for this was to reduce the risk of the develop-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        124.58807373046875,
        513.4854736328125,
        137.9395751953125
      ],
      "text": "ment and transmission of MDR-TB, and this change required that the same revisions",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        138.31906127929688,
        249.45687866210938,
        151.73956298828125
      ],
      "text": "(6) be considered for children  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        162.91754150390625,
        213.58839416503906,
        176.5450439453125
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 11 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        186.6666259765625,
        510.22637939453125,
        202.00062561035156
      ],
      "text": "Infants aged 0–3 months with suspected or confirmed pulmonary TB or tuber-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        199.86663818359375,
        513.2846069335938,
        215.2006378173828
      ],
      "text": "culous peripheral lymphadenitis should be promptly treated with the standard",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        213.066650390625,
        513.284423828125,
        228.40065002441406
      ],
      "text": "treatment regimens, as described in recommendation 9 or 10. Treatment may",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        226.26666259765625,
        513.2955322265625,
        241.6006622314453
      ],
      "text": "require dose adjustment to reconcile the effect of age and possible toxicity",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        239.4666748046875,
        513.2847290039062,
        254.80067443847656
      ],
      "text": "in young infants. The decision to adjust doses should be taken by a clinician",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        252.66668701171875,
        307.82635498046875,
        268.00067138671875
      ],
      "text": "experienced in managing paediatric TB",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        278.188232421875,
        347.8393859863281,
        291.53973388671875
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        302.9247131347656,
        513.4165649414062,
        316.34521484375
      ],
      "text": "Rapid advice: Treatment of tuberculosis in children. Source:   Geneva, World Health",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        316.793701171875,
        321.469970703125,
        330.14520263671875
      ],
      "text": "Organization, 2010 (WHO/HTM/TB/2010.13)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        341.53021240234375,
        513.439453125,
        354.9507141113281
      ],
      "text": "Remark:  There are very limited data to inform drug dosages for neonates, who have",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        355.3992004394531,
        513.4854125976562,
        368.7507019042969
      ],
      "text": "certain characteristics - especially in the first week of life - that are likely to affect",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        369.1991882324219,
        513.3935546875,
        382.5506896972656
      ],
      "text": "drug metabolism. Treatment of neonates may require dose adjustment to reconcile",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        382.9991760253906,
        510.2079162597656,
        396.3506774902344
      ],
      "text": "the effect of age and possible toxicity and should therefore be undertaken by a clini-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        396.7991638183594,
        513.3704833984375,
        410.1506652832031
      ],
      "text": "cian experienced in managing paediatric TB. If such expertise is not available, and TB",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        410.5991516113281,
        513.4049072265625,
        423.9506530761719
      ],
      "text": "has either been definitively diagnosed or is strongly suspected, treatment with the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.889404296875,
        424.3991394042969,
        313.1439514160156,
        437.7506408691406
      ],
      "text": "standard drug regimen may be considered.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.0414047241211,
        448.92864990234375,
        213.58840942382812,
        462.55615234375
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 12 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        472.6667175292969,
        513.2954711914062,
        488.0007019042969
      ],
      "text": "During the continuation phase of treatment, thrice-weekly regimens can be",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        485.8667297363281,
        513.2957153320312,
        501.2007141113281
      ],
      "text": "considered for children known not to be HIV-infected and living in settings with",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        499.0667419433594,
        359.163330078125,
        514.4007568359375
      ],
      "text": "well-established directly-observed therapy (DOT)",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        524.5881958007812,
        513.4509887695312,
        537.939697265625
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low quality of evidence for use of intermittent",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        538.3882446289062,
        301.81640625,
        551.73974609375
      ],
      "text": "treatment of children in specific settings)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        563.124755859375,
        513.47412109375,
        576.5452270507812
      ],
      "text": "Rapid advice: treatment of tuberculosis in children. Source:   Geneva, World Health",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        576.9937133789062,
        321.4699401855469,
        590.34521484375
      ],
      "text": "Organization, 2010 (WHO/HTM/TB/2010.13)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        601.7302856445312,
        513.4049072265625,
        615.1507568359375
      ],
      "text": "Remark:  Intermittent thrice-weekly regimens may be an alternative in a non-HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        615.5992431640625,
        513.4049682617188,
        628.9507446289062
      ],
      "text": "endemic setting, provided that each dose is directly observed, but should preferably",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        629.3992309570312,
        510.3000183105469,
        642.750732421875
      ],
      "text": "not be used to treat children living in settings with high HIV prevalence (or with con-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        643.19921875,
        513.4510498046875,
        656.5507202148438
      ],
      "text": "firmed HIV infection) or children with extensive pulmonary TB or disseminated forms",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        656.9302368164062,
        249.87091064453125,
        670.3507080078125
      ],
      "text": "(6, 8) of TB such as miliary TB  .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04139709472656,
        681.5287475585938,
        213.58839416503906,
        695.15625
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 13 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        705.2666015625,
        513.2953491210938,
        720.6005859375
      ],
      "text": "Streptomycin should not be used as part of first-line treatment regimens for",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        718.4666137695312,
        461.23248291015625,
        733.8005981445312
      ],
      "text": "children with pulmonary TB or tuberculous peripheral lymphadenitis",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        743.9880981445312,
        377.2218933105469,
        757.339599609375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, moderate quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        768.7246704101562,
        513.47412109375,
        782.1451416015625
      ],
      "text": "Rapid advice: treatment of tuberculosis in children. Source:   Geneva, World Health",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
